notes: >-
  The board tree and the reserved-memory/marker nodes are local.  The patch
  switches the MSM8909 SMD edge to the APCS mailbox, publishes the APCS regmap
  as a syscon so the legacy SMP2P/SMSM qcom,ipc users still work, and changes
  pm8916_wdt to warm reset so ramoops survives the PMIC watchdog.  The PON
  driver must be enabled (CONFIG_POWER_RESET_QCOM_PON) so the watchdog child
  gets populated, and CONFIG_QCOM_A53PLL must stay off: the block hangs this
  SoC before console init.
